00:29:55.420 --> 00:29:57.630
Well I think one of the
things that I was struck with.

00:29:57.630 --> 00:29:58.620
So overwhelming.

00:29:58.620 --> 00:30:03.210
Is, and this is a combination
of seeing the inside

00:30:03.210 --> 00:30:04.560
of what they would actually have to fly,

00:30:04.560 --> 00:30:06.190
