big Mythical Beasts.

00:30:27.040 --> 00:30:32.040
I was just struck with how
much they have to know.

00:30:32.050 --> 00:30:33.780
Well yeah, first of
all you gotta know what

00:30:33.780 --> 00:30:37.530
every button does and you
gotta know where it is.

00:30:37.530 --> 00:30:40.860
I guess you start to associate like,

00:30:40.860 --> 00:30:42.460
the physical location of the thing,

00:30:42.460 --> 00:30:44.280
and like after a while,
and that's why they have

00:30:44.280 --> 00:30:46.700
this thing there so you can
train and like second nature

00:30:46.700 --> 00:30:48.630
you just know where to
go for these buttons.

00:30:48.630 --> 00:30:50.640
Well, and they have contact, I mean,

00:30:50.640 --> 00:30:53.730
